1
00:00:00,446 --> 00:00:04,616
(Beverley:)I'm just not sure it's appropriate
with my son's roommate.

2
00:00:05,325 --> 00:00:07,205
(Sheldon:)Normally, I'd feel the same way.

3
00:00:07,369 --> 00:00:09,959
(Sheldon:)But based on everything
I've observed about us...

4
00:00:10,122 --> 00:00:14,002
(Sheldon:)...I can't help but speculate
we'd be very good together.

5
00:00:14,168 --> 00:00:16,588
(Beverley:)True. I've had a similar observation.

6
00:00:17,838 --> 00:00:21,128
(Beverley:)It's certainly something
I could never do with my husband.

7
00:00:23,302 --> 00:00:25,892
(Sheldon:)I was hesitant the first time I tried it...

8
00:00:26,055 --> 00:00:32,515
(Sheldon:)...but I experienced an unanticipated
and remarkable release of endorphins.

9
00:00:33,395 --> 00:00:35,985
(Sheldon:)- It's quite satisfying.
- Mm.

10
00:00:36,148 --> 00:00:37,648
(Beverley:)I see what you're doing.

11
00:00:37,816 --> 00:00:42,366
(Beverley:)You're appealing
to the neuroscientific researcher in me.

12
00:00:42,988 --> 00:00:45,368
(Sheldon:)You see right through me, don't you?

13
00:00:47,326 --> 00:00:48,956
(Beverley:)Only when you're in a CAT scanner.

14
00:00:49,119 --> 00:00:50,159
[SNORTS THEN LAUGHS]

15
00:00:53,832 --> 00:00:56,292
[BOTH MOANING AND LAUGHING]

16
00:00:58,170 --> 00:01:01,300
(Leonard:)This is actually gonna happen.

